Other options include:

hanging around Sokoban long enough for a coaligned unicorn to show up: it 
won't be able to teleport away so you can give it all your gems without 
wasting a genocide scroll.

Alternatively go and play elsewhere until you find out which wand is 
teleport then teleport the boulders instead of breaking them. It might not 
help, but you aren't any worse off if it doesn't, and if it does help you 
dont have a luck penalty.

